
===========================
ERBE LW Anisotropic Factors
===========================

Rows correspond to different viewing zenith angle ranges (0-15, 15-27, etc.).
Columns correspond to different colatitude ranges from North Pole (0-18, 18-36, etc.).

Reference: Suttles, J. T., R. N. Green, G. L. Smith, B. A. Wielicki, I. J. Walker, V. R. Taylor, and L. L. Stowe, 1989: 
           Angular radiation models for Earth-atmosphere system. Volume 2: Longwave radiation, NASA-RP-1184-VOL-2, 88pp, 
           [online] Available: https://hdl.handle.net/2060/19890011216.
	   
	   
